# test/remote/split.k4r -- SPLIT on a K4510 elsewhere: the split and its speed.
#     tools/k4510-remote run test/remote/split.k4r
# the machine's own colours first: a STARTUP.BAT may load another palette (Doc, 2026-09-15)
type PALETTE RESET\n
wait 1
type SPLIT\n
expect "lines a second" 10
shot split
screen
key esc
expect "/HOME]" 10
